ory changes.","evidence_ids":["cmd-8516d53800c04b0c","cmd-0a4edc51c6cf4908","cmd-898c11a12db546d8","cmd-159634d2089a4d12","cmd-025e381e5cac4dfa","cmd-6a19b9edd5de4f8d","cmd-0a8261faa8644c46","cmd-0a3ed60d61a04309","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. Password length and character-class enforcement was demonstrated through the real PAM password-change path, persisted across restart, and the platform was preserved. The mandatory node1 restart protocol was complete: healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, recovered services and access, preserved data, and matching lifecycle cross-checks were all captured.","limitations":[]}
